    "Shared cases of the contributor page link rules (ops decision D116 item 1; design PROFILE-PAGE-2026-10-06 §5.1). Every implementation of the steps in schemas/link-platforms.v1.json runs every case: the api and index-build in C#, the edge renderer in JavaScript, and this repository (scripts/check-link-rules.mjs, through scripts/lib/link-rules.mjs).",
    "`input` is exactly what a person pasted (JSON escapes make hostile characters visible here). `expect` is either the answer {form, handle[, instance], url} or {refused: code}, compared member by member. `tags` name the hostile classes a case exercises; check:links requires each of idn, javascript, data, userinfo, port and path-traversal among the link cases and among the website cases.",
    "Cases are added, never renumbered or removed. A reviewed table change that moves an answer moves that case in the same commit, and `tableSha256` is re-pinned to the table it was run against; an implementation compares it with the SHA-256 of the table it vendors."
  ],
